flowchart LR
 Actors[Guest / donor / admin] --> Auth((1 Identity and access))
 Auth <--> U[(User and session records)]
 Actors --> Camp((2 Campaign management))
 Camp <--> C[(Campaign records)]
 Actors --> Gift((3 Donation processing))
 Gift <--> D[(Donation and attempt records)]
 Gift --> Pay((4 Demo payment))
 Pay --> Gift
 Gift --> Receipt((5 Receipt and impact))
 Receipt <--> R[(Receipt records)]
 Actors --> Report((6 Reports, notifications, support))
 Report <--> A[(Audit, support, notification records)]
